//
// BIP37 vectors. The merkleblock section is written by
// pkgs/p2p_core/contrib/merkleblock.py from a v24.0.0-rc.3 mainnet node.
// Regenerate it with
// `python3 pkgs/p2p_core/contrib/merkleblock.py --node HOST:PORT COOKIE`.
//
// Every other section comes with the program used to generate its vectors,
// with the reference implementation at v24.0.0.
//
// To run a program, paste it at the end of the `bloom_tests` suite in
// `src/test/bloom_tests.cpp` at the specified revision, build it with
// `make -C src test/test_dash` and run
// `./src/test/test_dash --run_test=bloom_tests/<name>`. The output should match
// the section.
//

{
